    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26724" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lintĕātus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>clothed in linen</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">senex,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. de Vit. Beat. 26, 8</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">legio, a legion of Samnites, containing picked
					men,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 10, 38, 12</span></i>
