				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cohortes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					10, 41, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pallio deae Isidis linteata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Test. Anim. 2</span></i>
			.</div>
